      "content": "\n**Issue**: List all apps and ensure there's a route for the single view (no desktop)\n\n**Description**: The MainMenu component needs to display a comprehensive list of all available apps and ensure proper routing for single app view without requiring desktop context.\n\n**Requirements**:\n- List all apps available in the system\n- Ensure each app has a dedicated single-view route\n- Routes should work without requiring desktop context\n- App navigation should be intuitive and discoverable\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- \u2705 All apps are displayed in the main menu\n- \u2705 Each app has a working single-view route\n- \u2705 Routes function independently without desktop requirement\n- \u2705 Users can navigate directly to single app views\n- \u2705 App listing is complete and up-to-date",
